# NESTING: quantified groups containing quantified subexpressions, two and three levels deep, mixed greedy/lazy, bounded-inside-bounded with large products.
# Auto-generated for the D27 quantifier/bounded-repeat corpus.
# Every expectation is computed directly from python's re module.

# two levels, both greedy
pattern (a{2,3}){2,3}
m "aaaa" 0 4
g 1 2 4
n "aa"
m "aaaaaa" 0 6
g 1 3 6
m "aaaaaaaaa" 0 9
g 1 6 9
m "aaaaaaaaaa" 0 9
g 1 6 9
n "a"
m "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" 0 9
g 1 6 9

# two levels, inner lazy
