# bounded-in-bounded, product 1000, small subject
pattern (a{1,20}){1,50}
m "aaaaa" 0 5
g 1 0 5
m "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" 0 20
g 1 0 20
m "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" 0 100
g 1 80 100
m "" 0 900
g 1 880 900
m "" 0 1000
g 1 980 1000
m "" 0 1000
g 1 980 1000

# bounded-in-bounded, tighter inner range, product 1000
pattern (a{10,20}){10,50}
n "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
